// AWS IAM Inline Policy Added to Role  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098.003
// Detects addition of an inline policy to an IAM role (PutRolePolicy). Used to silently widen a role's permissions.
// False positives: Legitimate fine-grained role permission grants.
// Source: rules/privilege-escalation/iam-put-role-policy.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^PutRolePolicy$/i eventSource=/^iam\.amazonaws\.com$/i
